# Reverse engineering — spec section 15.

radare2
gdb-multiarch
ltrace
strace
binutils
bless

# plain `gdb` intentionally not repeated here — already installed via
# raptor-development.list.chroot. gdb-multiarch kept explicit since it's
# RE-specific (cross-arch debugging) and dev doesn't need it by default.

# NOTE: Ghidra is not packaged for Debian — it ships as a standalone
# archive from its GitHub releases. If wanted, add it via a
# build/config/hooks/live/ hook that downloads and unpacks a pinned
# release, not this package list.
